      "statement": "Three GitHub Actions workflows exist for automated maintenance: update-models.yml (daily 03:00 UTC), update-anthropic-models.yml (daily 03:15 UTC), and openwiki-update.yaml (bi-weekly Sat 05:00 UTC on even ISO weeks).",
