      "id": "claim_0321b6b63c95468dab186fae9c1ba5cf",
      "statement": "The update-anthropic-models.yml workflow runs scripts/generate_anthropic_models.py which fetches models from Anthropic API (GET /v1/models), filters to type=='model', sorts by id, fetches and parses Anthropic pricing data, joins pricing onto models, adds long-context pricing tiers, writes anthropic-models.json and appends to history/anthropic-models.jsonl, then creates a PR that attempts immediate merge. The script fails closed (exits with error, no output) if any model lacks pricing or pricing data is invalid.",
