      "statement": "The openwiki-update.yaml workflow uses a gate job to check ISO week parity (even weeks only), then fetches all sanity_ok models from models-openwiki.json and loops through them until one succeeds running 'openwiki code --update --print', creating a PR on branch openwiki/update without auto-merge.",
